Output docs/vhs/out/03-multipart-upload.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "export SENDITO_KEYCHAIN=memory && cd /tmp/sendito-demo && clear" Enter
Show
Type "sendito" Enter
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+N Type "{{base_url}}/upload" Alt+3 Enter Type "multi" Enter Down
Type "title" Enter Enter Type "Q3" Down Type "report" Enter Space Enter Type "report.txt"
F5 Sleep 1500ms Ctrl+W Type "j" Sleep 1500ms
Ctrl+Q
